{"change_summary":"Verified that the branch already contains the approved tanksim-6e5.6.3 molt/mineral fixes, so this apply-fixes pass was validation-only and required no source edits. I rechecked the current shrimp GH/cadence guard wiring and reran focused molt/validation coverage plus the full `tank_core`, `tank_data`, and `tank_scenarios` suites; all passed on current HEAD.","outstanding_risks":["Workspace still has unrelated dirty-tree entries (`.claude/worktrees/tanksim-6e5.4.7` and `.ralph-burning/`) that were left untouched in this validation-only pass."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the current worktree and the relevant shrimp molt/mineral parameter and regression paths to confirm the approved fixes were already present before making any edits.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran formatting checks and focused `tank_core` regressions for molt/mineral and runtime validation behavior.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran the full `tank_core` suite plus downstream `tank_data` and `tank_scenarios` tests to confirm broader stability, then recorded this stage as validation-only because no new code changes were needed.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git status --short`","`rg -n \"critical_molt_gh_ratio|temp_condition_min_factor|test_zero_gh_min_parameter_uses_defensive_guard|test_temp_condition_min_factor_controls_molt_cadence_floor\" crates/tank_core crates/tank_data crates/tank_scenarios`","`cargo fmt --all --check`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test molt_mineral_budget -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test validation -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_data -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core -- --nocapture`"]}